00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,680
 reality, his gospel, his atonement, and his resurrection.

2
00:00:05,680 --> 00:00:10,320
 Yet, the sacred responsibility to bear witness of Jesus Christ

3
00:00:10,320 --> 00:00:13,640
 is not limited to prophets and apostles.

4
00:00:13,640 --> 00:00:17,400
 It extends to all his disciples.

5
00:00:17,400 --> 00:00:20,520
 The truth of the restored gospel of Jesus Christ

6
00:00:20,520 --> 00:00:25,360
 is manifest in the lives of millions of his followers

7
00:00:25,360 --> 00:00:29,040
 throughout the world, through your testimonies,

8
00:00:29,040 --> 00:00:30,780
 in word and deed.

